    {
      "id": "wallet-text-00196",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 199,
      "y": 4332,
      "width": 2565,
      "height": 34.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#17243C",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "wallet-frame-00165",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1432080032,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 675277504,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795009374685,
      "created": 1795009374685,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Travar a carteira → consultar idempotency_key → inserir extrato → atualizar saldo. Em chaves globais em carteiras distintas, tratar DUP_VAL_ON_INDEX e consultar o registro vencedor.",
