      "text": "docker compose up -d (Oracle + healthcheck)\nbootstrap de usuários via script/env\nFlyway AUDIT one-shot → Flyway OWNER one-shot\nAPI apenas usa credencial WALLET_APP\nREADME + OpenAPI; sem ddl-auto=update",
      "originalText": "docker compose up -d (Oracle + healthcheck)\nbootstrap de usuários via script/env\nFlyway AUDIT one-shot → Flyway OWNER one-shot\nAPI apenas usa credencial WALLET_APP\nREADME + OpenAPI; sem ddl-auto=update",
